@startuml
title US-001 - Register organization and admin - SSD level 1
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "Nexo" as System

note over System
  Registration outcome only; credential/provider interaction\n  needs a separate contract before implementation.
end note
Admin -> System: Register organization and admin account
activate System
alt Request accepted
    System --> Admin: Organization and admin account created; signed in
else Invalid required details
    System --> Admin: Validation errors; nothing created
else Email already registered
    System --> Admin: Conflict; nothing created
end
deactivate System
@enduml
